cesso.\n\nUma casa pensada para quem deseja mais do que morar: deseja viver com espaço, conforto e exclusividade.\n\nAgende sua visita e venha conhecer todos os detalhes desta propriedade!\n\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a alteração sem aviso prévio. Consulte nossos corretores.\n\n#Curitiba #Abranches #CasaAltoPadrao #CasaEmCondominio #QuatroSuites #ImoveisCuritiba #MyBrokerImoveis25:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"details\":{\"id\":","fotos":["https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220952/IMG_1832_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220952/IMG_1658_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220932/IMG_1665_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220952/IMG_1660_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220932/IMG_1669_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220932/IMG_1671_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220934/IMG_1674_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220934/IMG_1675_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220932/IMG_1678_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220936/IMG_1693_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220934/IMG_1684_editada-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20261117220932/IMG_1688_editada-watermarked.webp","https